<topic id="installation">
  <title>Installation Guide</title>
  <body>
    <p>This guide explains how to install the software on your system.</p>
    <section>
      <title>Prerequisites</title>
      <p>Before installing, ensure you have:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Operating System: Linux, Windows, or macOS</li>
        <li>Disk Space: 500 MB available</li>
        <li>Memory: 2 GB RAM minimum</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <title>Installation Steps</title>
      <ol>
        <li>Download the installer package</li>
        <li>Run the installation wizard</li>
        <li>Follow the on-screen prompts</li>
        <li>Complete the installation</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </body>
</topic>
